{"id":28510,"slug":"the-freshman","title":"The Freshman","year":1925,"country":"United States","duration":76,"spine":703,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28510-the-freshman","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/cbda2b73d58c94da90d718beb2a6212f/grzsX7mRu1vFpl7oMh12x96ahSdYbj_large.jpg","description":"Harold Lloyd’s biggest box-office hit was this silent comedy gem, featuring the befuddled everyman at his eager best as a new college student. Though he dreams of being a big man on campus, the freshman’s careful plans inevitably go hilariously awry, be it on the football field or at the Fall Frolic. But he gets a climactic chance to prove his mettle—and impress the sweet girl he loves—in one of the most famous sports sequences ever filmed. This crowd-pleaser is a gleeful showcase for Lloyd’s slapstick brilliance and incandescent charm, and it is accompanied here by a new orchestral score by Carl Davis.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Fred Newmeyer","slug":"fred-newmeyer"},{"name":"Sam Taylor","slug":"sam-taylor"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Harold Lloyd","role":"The freshman","slug":"harold-lloyd"},{"actor":"Jobyna Ralston","role":"Peggy","slug":"jobyna-ralston"},{"actor":"Brooks Benedict","role":"The college cad","slug":"brooks-benedict"},{"actor":"James Anderson","role":"The college hero","slug":"james-anderson"},{"actor":"Hazel Keener","role":"The college belle","slug":"hazel-keener"},{"actor":"Joseph Harrington","role":"The college tailor","slug":"joseph-harrington"},{"actor":"Pat Harmon","role":"The football coach","slug":"pat-harmon"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Sam Taylor","slug":"sam-taylor"},{"role":"Director","person":"Fred Newmeyer","slug":"fred-newmeyer"},{"role":"Story by","person":"Sam Taylor","slug":"sam-taylor"},{"role":"Story by","person":"Ted Wilde","slug":"ted-wilde"},{"role":"Story by","person":"John Grey","slug":null},{"role":"Story by","person":"Tim Whelan","slug":"tim-whelan"},{"role":"Photographed b